repository-code: 'https://github.com/electronic-patient-record/electronic-patient-record'
abstract: >-
  Open-source electronic patient record software: a safe, append-only, audited
  longitudinal patient record with a FHIR R4 facade and explainable patient identity
  matching. A Rust matcher library, a Rust REST service and a SvelteKit front end.
  Pre-release scaffold; not for clinical use.
keywords:
  - electronic patient record
  - FHIR
  - patient identity matching
  - Rust
  - Svelte
